  "fundamentalsQueryTitle": "Performance guarantees and indexes",
  "fundamentalsQueryHint": "Firestore answers from indexes, not by scanning the collection. That is the performance guarantee: query cost stays predictable as the data grows. One range filter plus orderBy on the same field can use the automatic single-field index. Two range filters on different fields cannot. Equality on one field plus a range on another needs a composite index — Firestore answers with a Console URL. This lab does not create that index.",
